        "summary":  "The article explores six critical strategic decisions CIOs must navigate, including balancing foundational IT investments with growth initiatives, managing innovation against operational resilience, and weighing AI adoption costs against innovation benefits. AI adoption and cybersecurity have intensified these longstanding tensions, requiring technology leaders to make deliberate choices that satisfy multiple competing stakeholder objectives simultaneously.",
